==Battleground==
*1 [[Ururun Wolf (Enemy)|Ururun Wolf]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Li'l Nyandam (Enemy)|Li'l Nyandam]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Codename "Red Riding"]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Inumusha]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Mecha-Bun (Enemy)|Mecha-Bun]] spawns after 150 seconds<sup>4,500f</sup>.
*10 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
There are multiple ways to beat this stage, ranging from killing everything before hitting the base to destroying the base before any boss dies. One way may involve fast rushers such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] and [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Immortal Yukimura]] quickly killing Ururun Wolf and Codename "Red Riding", then proceeding to attack the enemy base.

The most standard way would involve preparing an army capable of holding back Mecha-Bun and using it alongside [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|wave attackers]] to hold back Inumusha and fight Mecha-Bun at the same time, either after killing Codename "Red Riding" or while holding her outside of your base's range.

==Trivia==
*Hell's All-Stars' Japanese name, Satan All-Stars, could be a reference to the band [[wikipedia:Southern All-Stars|Southern All-Stars]], since ''Southern'' is pronounced ''Sazan'' in Japanese.
*This stage is the only one that plays [[Music|Filibuster's theme]] without including [[Filibuster Obstructa]] or any variation of it.

